      * RPG III string operations: CAT, SCAN, SUBST, CHECK, CHEKR
     H
      * CAT
     C           FIRST     CAT  LAST:1    NAME   30
     C           FIRST     CAT  LAST:0    NAME2  30 P
     C           FIRST     CAT  LAST      FULL   60
     C                     CAT  TAIL:2    NAME
      * SCAN
     C           'AB'      SCAN STRING:T  POS     30
     C           KEY:3     SCAN STRING    POS
     C           'AB'      SCAN STRING                   90
     C           'AB'      SCAN STRING    POS            91
      * CHECK and CHEKR
     C           DIGITS    CHECKSTRING:2  N       30     92
     C           ' '       CHEKRSTRING    LEN     30
      * SUBST
     C           3         SUBSTSTRING:T  OUT    10
     C           3         SUBSTSTRING:T  OUT2   10 P
     C                     SUBSTSTRING:T  OUT
      * Not converted
     C           3         SUBSTSTRING:T  OUT          93
     C           'AB'      SCAN STRING    POS       P
     C           'AB'      SCAN STRING
     C           FIRST     CAT  *BLANK    NAME
     C           FIRST     CAT  LAST:N    NAME
     C           'AB':'CD' XLATESTRING    OUT
